# Analysis Summary

Enterprise Information Flow establishes the authorized movement of enterprise information between authoritative owners, authorized consumers, and authorized reference capabilities.

Information flow is governed by enterprise authorization relationships.

Information flow never transfers ownership.

Enterprise information remains independent of runtime execution, orchestration, persistence, APIs, messaging, implementation, and technology.

